        "title": "The charts below give information on the location and types of dance classes young people in a town in Australia are currently attending. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cz8GdNdeWoSpTmxEBXglqLdJggc\"><em><strong>The charts below give information on the location and types of dance classes young people in a town in Australia are currently attending.</strong></em><em><strong> Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Dance Classes in Australia</em></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>) <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/4Xz4bVyZcSY?si=gYxlsTVlVtOqVbfA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</a></span></span></em></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">Đề b&agrave;i Dance Classes in Australia y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả 2 biểu đồ:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K5OBdqIlGouytXxTZrYltqgDgLd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Pie chart thể hiện so s&aacute;nh sự đa dạng của c&aacute;c địa điểm tổ chức lớp học khi&ecirc;u vũ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WgDzdtXfiofoEnxwObml5yP1gf8\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bar chart thể hiện ba loại phong c&aacute;ch khi&ecirc;u vũ m&agrave; học vi&ecirc;n từ hai nh&oacute;m tuổi kh&aacute;c nhau đang học ở một thị trấn của Australia.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SWxDdnrhaoWRUmxj4hJlZurJgBh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/124/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570-internal?collection=lesson&amp;item=4\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> v&agrave;&nbsp; <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> </a></strong></span>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VcIwdcyD3obYdJxrVgZlkQwIgAb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Dance Classes in Australia với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: pie chart - c&aacute;c nơi tổ chức lớp học nhảy - bar chart - 3 thể loại nhảy - độ tuổi - Australia.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QZuWdhvTyoJJNVxWwVAljRgBgHc\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề mixed charts, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ULsddpDdjoW0r2xvsfPlKOqQgYd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>private studio cao nhất - ballet phổ biến với độ tuổi dưới 11 - modern phổ biến với nh&oacute;m tuổi lớn hơn</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch chia mỗi chart v&agrave;o 1 BODY, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Pie chart</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GhM4dPyRPoNvb6x8WBIlQCq3gRh\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RTw3d71u6oqB6gxt1OPl0dwYgVf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của private studio&nbsp; </strong><em>(48%, phổ biến nhất</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N03VdxJKNojCCFx4GyOlu6N3goc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của college-based studios v&agrave; school halls</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><em>(school halls l&agrave; 10%, college-based studios l&agrave; 24%</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DJfVd1SwMoBsShxctfBlgm5hgTc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>số liệu của Community halls and other places</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><em>(chiếm 18%</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R1qldBVmjoSw2exeRmmlXm6Gg3e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Bar chart</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R1qldBVmjoSw2exeRmmlXm6Gg3e\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"33\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"35\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</span></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ulc6dDDQdoRBXWxCe4AltRW4g0c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của 2 nh&oacute;m tuổi trong lớp ballet&nbsp;</strong><em>(under 11 <strong>gấp đ&ocirc;i</strong> so với 11-16)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lwlud9uGloD1s8xXF2elrCoGgpd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của 2 nh&oacute;m tuổi trong lớp modern </strong><em>(under 11 <strong>nhỏ hơn rất nhiều</strong> so với 11-16</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZMYddPAusoVRRYx5A56lg7EdgCf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của 2 nh&oacute;m tuổi trong lớp tap dance&nbsp;</strong><em>(under 11 <strong>lớn hơn một t&iacute;</strong> so với 11-16</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn n&oacute;i về việc <strong>\"được tổ chức\"</strong> th&igrave; ngo&agrave;i cụm&nbsp;<strong>\"to be held\"</strong> như trong đề b&agrave;i th&igrave; m&igrave;nh cũng c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng cụm <strong>\"to be hosted\"</strong> nha.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BJ6PdRsSJoeHp9xWPaZlbXKVgme\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IY0UdZPGNoyAjGxvfYUlI9VxgOc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Meanwhile, 18% of dance classes are hosted in community halls and other places.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 201,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DRKgdVBsAomKwmxnJ9ilsXhFg8b\">The pie chart compares the variety of locations where dance classes are hosted, whereas the bar graph illustrates three types of dance styles that students from two different age groups are learning in an Australian town.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13653,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 202,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Orx7dShi2oH3GkxWTvelwbXPgYd\">Overall, private studios are the preferred choice of location among dance students. In addition, ballet classes attract the highest number of students under 11 years old, whereas modern dance classes are most popular with the older age group.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13653,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 203,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DpLHdX6Lpov0Txxpqntlw1tjgxd\">Looking first where classes are held, a significant number of students choose private studios, at 48%, making it the most popular option. The figures for the two academic facilities, which include school halls and studios located in universities, are 24% and 10% respectively. Meanwhile, 18% of dance classes are hosted in community halls and other places.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13653,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 204,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SJHXd7ExqoEs0Tx86JYlDtDJg7e\">Regarding dance styles, 600 students aged under 11 engage in ballet classes, which is double the number of 11-16-year-olds. Modern dance is the least popular among the younger age group, with only 300 students choosing it, far lower than the figure for the older age group, which has 600 participants taking the class. Finally, there is a smaller disparity between the two demographics in tap dance enrollment, with 480 children under 11 and 430 children from 11 to 16 years old participating.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13653,
            "is_toggle_on": true
